        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 474,
          "text": "4.2 Sample Selection Approach"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 498,
          "text": "- Population: Multi-element contracts booked Oct 2024–Jan 2025 (n = 58)"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 513,
          "text": "- Sample size: 10 contracts, judgmentally selected to include higher-value and higher-variance arrangements"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 546,
          "text": "5. Testing Procedures Performed"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 570,
          "text": "- Obtained standard list price catalogue from Pricing Team"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 588,
          "text": "- Recalculated SSP allocation using the approved formula"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 606,
          "text": "- Compared recalculated allocation to system-booked values"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 621,
          "text": "- For variances >20%, traced to Finance Manager sign-off evidence"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 654,
          "text": "6. Findings Summary"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 681,
          "text": "6.1 Recalculation Results"
        },
